what is memmory leak
---------------------
"A memory leak happens when an app keeps resources in memory even after they are no longer needed, causing memory usage to increase over time."

So what does GC do?
--------------------
Garbage Collector automatically finds objects that are no longer reachable/needed and frees their memory.


